### 상품 생성 (201, Location 헤더 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "콜라", "price": 1500, "imageUrl": "https://example.com/cola.png"}

### 상품 목록 조회 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 상품 단건 조회 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 상품 수정 (200, 다시 조회하면 값이 바뀌어 있어야 한다)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "사이다", "price": 1400, "imageUrl": "https://example.com/cider.png"}

### 상품 삭제 (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 잘못된 이름 (지금은 500, 4단계 이후 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "콜라!", "price": 1500, "imageUrl": "https://example.com/cola.png"}
